<!-- ═══ DishNet Smart Quote Template — UGANDA EDITION v2 (derived from SS v5) ═══ -->
<!-- v2: the Service Agreement as pages 3–4, adapted from South Sudan's for Uganda (docs/67 §L).            -->
<!-- Uganda positioning: IT solutions company & Starlink installer (no UCC licence claimed: docs/67 §E). -->
<!-- Not an ISP; prices UGX; service prepaid; kits are SOLD. VAT wording follows   -->
<!-- the quote's own tax lines, so it stays true before and after registration.    -->
<!-- 5.18.49: with no tax lines, every quote says its prices include all taxes,    -->
<!-- URA taxes and UCC charges — the operator's wording of 27 Sep 2026.            -->

{# ── AUTO-DETECT STARLINK ITEMS (badge only — terms below are one set) ── #}
{% set is_starlink = false %}
{% set all_labels = '' %}
{% for item in items %}
  {% set all_labels = all_labels ~ ' ' ~ item.label %}
{% endfor %}
{% if 'Starlink' in all_labels or 'starlink' in all_labels or 'STARLINK' in all_labels or 'Kit' in all_labels %}
  {% set is_starlink = true %}
{% endif %}

{# ── Dynamic sales person from client attribute, fallback to Bhavin ── #}
{% set agent_name = client.getAttribute('salesPerson') %}
{% if agent_name is empty %}
  {% set agent_name = 'Bhavin Madlani' %}
{% endif %}

{# ── Company registration facts, preferring what uCRM's Organization holds ── #}
{% set org_tin = '1059140632' %}
{% if organization.taxId is defined and organization.taxId %}{% set org_tin = organization.taxId %}{% endif %}
{% set org_reg = '80046255496181' %}
{% if organization.registrationNumber is defined and organization.registrationNumber %}{% set org_reg = organization.registrationNumber %}{% endif %}

<!-- FOOTER pinned to bottom -->
<div class="dn-footer-wrap">
  <div style="height:3px;background:#D41C1C;"></div>
  <table style="width:100%;background:#141414;border-collapse:collapse;">
    <tr>
      <td style="padding:8px 28px;font-size:9px;color:#aaa;">{{ organization.name }} &middot; Kampala, Uganda &middot; TIN {{ org_tin }}</td>
      <td style="padding:8px 28px;font-size:10px;color:#999;text-align:center;font-style:italic;font-weight:600;">Of course we can ...</td>
      <td style="padding:8px 28px;font-size:9px;color:#999;text-align:right;">Sales: +256 705 993 348 | {% if organization.website %}{{ organization.website }}{% else %}www.dishnetuganda.com{% endif %}</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<!-- HEADER -->
<table style="width:100%;background:#141414;border-collapse:collapse;" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:18px 28px 14px;vertical-align:middle;">
      <table style="border-collapse:collapse;"><tr>
        <td style="padding:0;vertical-align:middle;">
          <div style="font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#ffffff;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-0.5px;">DishNet</div>
          <div style="height:5px;width:120px;background:#D41C1C;margin-top:3px;"></div>
        </td>
        <td style="padding:0 0 0 10px;vertical-align:middle;">
          {% if is_starlink %}
            <span style="display:inline-block;background:#333;border:1px solid #555;color:#fff;font-size:8px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1.5px;padding:3px 8px 2px;border-radius:3px;text-transform:uppercase;">STARLINK</span>
          {% endif %}
        </td>
      </tr></table>
      <div style="font-size:9px;color:#bbb;margin-top:4px;letter-spacing:0.3px;">IT Solutions Provider &middot; Starlink Installation &middot; Kampala, Uganda</div>
    </td>
    <td style="padding:18px 28px 14px;text-align:right;vertical-align:middle;">
      <div style="font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;color:#bbb;">QUOTATION</div>
      <div style="font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:#fff;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:0.5px;">{{ quote.number }}</div>
      <div style="font-size:9px;color:#aaa;">{{ quote.createdDate }}</div>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
<div style="height:3px;background:#D41C1C;"></div>

<!-- CONTENT -->
<div style="padding:16px 28px 45px;">

  <!-- BILL TO / FROM -->
  <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:10px 0;margin-bottom:16px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width:50%;background:#f8f8f8;border-radius:6px;padding:12px 14px;vertical-align:top;border-left:3px solid #D41C1C;">
        <div style="font-size:8px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:#777;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px;">BILL TO</div>
        <div style="font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#141414;margin-bottom:3px;">{{ client.name }}</div>
        {% if client.companyName %}<div style="font-size:10px;color:#6B6B6B;font-weight:600;">{{ client.companyName }}</div>{% endif %}
        <div style="font-size:10px;color:#6B6B6B;line-height:1.5;">
          {% if client.invoiceAddressSameAsContact %}
            {% if client.street1 %}{{ client.street1 }}{% endif %}{% if client.street2 %}, {{ client.street2 }}{% endif %}<br>
            {% if client.city %}{{ client.city }}{% endif %}{% if client.state %}, {{ client.state }}{% endif %}<br>
            {% if client.country %}{{ client.country }}{% endif %}
          {% else %}
            {% if client.invoiceStreet1 %}{{ client.invoiceStreet1 }}{% endif %}{% if client.invoiceStreet2 %}, {{ client.invoiceStreet2 }}{% endif %}<br>
            {% if client.invoiceCity %}{{ client.invoiceCity }}{% endif %}{% if client.invoiceState %}, {{ client.invoiceState }}{% endif %}<br>
            {% if client.invoiceCountry %}{{ client.invoiceCountry }}{% endif %}
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        {% if client.firstBillingPhone %}<div style="font-size:10px;color:#6B6B6B;">{{ client.firstBillingPhone }}</div>{% endif %}
        {% if client.firstGeneralPhone and client.firstGeneralPhone != client.firstBillingPhone %}<div style="font-size:10px;color:#6B6B6B;">{{ client.firstGeneralPhone }}</div>{% endif %}
        {% if client.firstBillingEmail %}<div style="font-size:10px;color:#6B6B6B;">{{ client.firstBillingEmail }}</div>{% endif %}
      </td>
      <td style="width:50%;background:#f8f8f8;border-radius:6px;padding:12px 14px;vertical-align:top;border-left:3px solid #141414;">
        <div style="font-size:8px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:#777;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px;">FROM</div>
        <div style="font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#141414;margin-bottom:3px;">{{ organization.name }}</div>
        <div style="font-size:10px;color:#6B6B6B;line-height:1.5;">
          {{ organization.street1 }}{% if organization.street2 %}, {{ organization.street2 }}{% endif %}<br>
          {{ organization.city }}{% if organization.state %}, {{ organization.state }}{% endif %}<br>
          TIN: {{ org_tin }} &middot; Reg. No: {{ org_reg }}<br>
          {% if organization.phone %}{{ organization.phone }}{% endif %}<br>
          {% if organization.email %}{{ organization.email }}{% endif %}<br>
          {% if organization.website %}{{ organization.website }}{% endif %}
        </div>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <!-- ITEMS TABLE -->
  <div style="font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;color:#666;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:5px;">QUOTATION DETAILS</div>
  <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-bottom:4px;">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="background:#141414;color:#fff;font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.8px;padding:9px 10px;font-weight:700;text-align:left;width:5%;">#</th>
        <th style="background:#141414;color:#fff;font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.8px;padding:9px 10px;font-weight:700;text-align:left;width:43%;">Description</th>
        <th style="background:#141414;color:#fff;font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.8px;padding:9px 10px;font-weight:700;text-align:right;width:12%;">Qty</th>
        <th style="background:#141414;color:#fff;font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.8px;padding:9px 10px;font-weight:700;text-align:right;width:18%;">Unit Price</th>
        <th style="background:#141414;color:#fff;font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.8px;padding:9px 10px;font-weight:700;text-align:right;width:22%;">Amount (UGX)</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% set row_num = 1 %}
      {% for item in items %}
        <tr style="{% if loop.index is even %}background:#fafafa;{% endif %}">
          <td style="padding:10px;font-size:11px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f0f0;color:#888;font-weight:600;">{{ row_num }}</td>
          <td style="padding:10px;font-size:11px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f0f0;">
            <strong style="font-size:12px;">{{ item.label }}</strong>
            {% if item.unit %}<br><span style="font-size:8px;color:#9B9B9B;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;">{{ item.type }} - {{ item.unit }}</span>{% endif %}
          </td>
          <td style="padding:10px;font-size:11px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f0f0;text-align:right;">{{ item.quantity }}</td>
          <td style="padding:10px;font-size:11px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f0f0;text-align:right;">{{ item.price }}</td>
          <td style="padding:10px;font-size:11px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f0f0;text-align:right;font-weight:700;">{{ item.total }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% set row_num = row_num + 1 %}
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <!-- TOTALS -->
  <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-bottom:14px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width:58%;border:none;"></td>
      <td style="width:42%;border:none;padding:0;">
        <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:#f8f8f8;border-radius:6px;">
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:6px 14px;font-size:11px;color:#6B6B6B;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;">Subtotal</td>
            <td style="padding:6px 14px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;">{{ totals.subtotal }}</td>
          </tr>
          {% if totals.hasDiscount %}
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:6px 14px;font-size:11px;color:#059669;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;">{{ totals.discountLabel }}</td>
            <td style="padding:6px 14px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;text-align:right;color:#059669;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;">{{ totals.discountPrice }}</td>
          </tr>
          {% endif %}
          {% for tax in totals.taxes %}
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:6px 14px;font-size:11px;color:#6B6B6B;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;">{{ tax.label }}</td>
            <td style="padding:6px 14px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;">{{ tax.price }}</td>
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:9px 14px;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;background:#141414;">Total Due</td>
            <td style="padding:9px 14px;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;text-align:right;color:#fff;background:#141414;">{{ totals.total }}</td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <!-- PAYMENT DETAILS -->
  <div style="font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;color:#666;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:5px;">PAYMENT DETAILS &mdash; BANK TRANSFER</div>
  <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-bottom:12px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="background:#f8f8f8;border-radius:6px;padding:10px 14px;border-left:3px solid #D41C1C;">
        <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;">
          <tr>
            <td style="width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding:0 8px 0 0;">
              <div style="font-size:10px;color:#444;line-height:1.6;">
                <b style="color:#141414;">Beneficiary:</b> DISHNET AFRICA LIMITED<br>
                <b style="color:#141414;">Bank:</b> Ecobank Uganda Limited &mdash; Head Office<br>
                <b style="color:#141414;">Bank Address:</b> Plot 4 Parliament Avenue, Kampala, Uganda
              </div>
            </td>
            <td style="width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding:0 0 0 8px;">
              <div style="font-size:10px;color:#444;line-height:1.6;">
                <b style="color:#141414;">UGX Account:</b> 7247510191<br>
                <b style="color:#141414;">USD Account:</b> 7247510192 <span style="color:#6B6B6B;">(international)</span><br>
                <b style="color:#141414;">SWIFT/BIC:</b> ECOCUGKA
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
        <div style="font-size:9px;color:#6B6B6B;margin-top:6px;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-top:5px;">
          Pay in the currency of this quotation and use <b style="color:#141414;">{{ quote.number }}</b> as the payment reference.
          Please ensure the beneficiary name and account number are entered exactly as shown above.
        </div>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <!-- VALIDITY -->
  <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-bottom:12px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #86efac;border-radius:6px;padding:9px 14px;font-size:10px;color:#065f46;">
        <b style="color:#059669;font-size:12px;margin-right:6px;">V</b>
        Valid for <strong>7 days</strong> from date of issue. Prices subject to change after expiry.
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <!-- NOTES -->
  {% if quote.notes %}
  <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-bottom:12px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;border-radius:6px;padding:9px 14px;">
        <div style="font-size:8px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;color:#92400e;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:3px;">NOTES</div>
        <div style="font-size:10px;color:#78350f;line-height:1.5;">{{ quote.notes }}</div>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
  {% endif %}

  <div style="font-size:9px;color:#6B6B6B;margin-top:2px;">
    This quotation is governed by the Service Process and Terms &amp; Conditions on page 2 and the Service Agreement on pages 3&ndash;4, which form part of it.
  </div>

  <!-- ═══ PAGE 2 — SERVICE PROCESS & TERMS ═══ -->
  <div style="page-break-before:always;"></div>
  <div style="padding-top:14px;">
    <div style="font-size:9px;color:#999;">DishNet &mdash; Quotation {{ quote.number }} &middot; Service Process &amp; Terms &amp; Conditions</div>
    <div style="height:2px;background:#D41C1C;margin:4px 0 12px;width:120px;"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- HOW WE WORK -->
  <div style="font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;color:#666;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px;">HOW WE WORK &mdash; FROM ORDER TO ONLINE</div>
  <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:6px;margin-bottom:4px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width:33%;background:#f8f8f8;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px;vertical-align:top;border-top:3px solid #D41C1C;">
        <div style="font-size:10px;font-weight:800;color:#141414;">1 &middot; QUOTE &amp; ACCEPTANCE</div>
        <div style="font-size:9px;color:#444;line-height:1.45;margin-top:2px;">You accept this quotation by signing it, confirming in writing, or making payment. Acceptance in any of these ways is agreement to the Terms &amp; Conditions below.</div>
      </td>
      <td style="width:33%;background:#f8f8f8;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px;vertical-align:top;border-top:3px solid #141414;">
        <div style="font-size:10px;font-weight:800;color:#141414;">2 &middot; PAYMENT</div>
        <div style="font-size:9px;color:#444;line-height:1.45;margin-top:2px;">One-time charges (equipment, installation) and the first service month are paid in full before delivery or installation is scheduled, using the bank details on page 1.</div>
      </td>
      <td style="width:33%;background:#f8f8f8;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px;vertical-align:top;border-top:3px solid #D41C1C;">
        <div style="font-size:10px;font-weight:800;color:#141414;">3 &middot; SITE &amp; PERMISSIONS</div>
        <div style="font-size:9px;color:#444;line-height:1.45;margin-top:2px;">You confirm the installation site, that you have the right to install there (including landlord permission where relevant), and that the dish location has a clear view of the sky.</div>
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="background:#f8f8f8;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px;vertical-align:top;border-top:3px solid #141414;">
        <div style="font-size:10px;font-weight:800;color:#141414;">4 &middot; DELIVERY &amp; INSTALLATION</div>
        <div style="font-size:9px;color:#444;line-height:1.45;margin-top:2px;">Installation is scheduled on a mutually agreed date after payment clears. Dates and lead times are estimates in good faith, not guarantees. Non-standard work is agreed and priced before it begins.</div>
      </td>
      <td style="background:#f8f8f8;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px;vertical-align:top;border-top:3px solid #D41C1C;">
        <div style="font-size:10px;font-weight:800;color:#141414;">5 &middot; ACTIVATION &amp; HANDOVER</div>
        <div style="font-size:9px;color:#444;line-height:1.45;margin-top:2px;">We activate the service, demonstrate it working at handover, and hand you the connection details.</div>
      </td>
      <td style="background:#f8f8f8;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px;vertical-align:top;border-top:3px solid #141414;">
        <div style="font-size:10px;font-weight:800;color:#141414;">6 &middot; AFTER-SALES SUPPORT</div>
        <div style="font-size:9px;color:#444;line-height:1.45;margin-top:2px;">On a DishNet service plan, DishNet manages the Starlink account. DishNet provides ongoing local support on +256 705 993 348 (WhatsApp and calls) for as long as your service is active with us.</div>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
  <div style="font-size:8px;color:#6B6B6B;margin-bottom:12px;">The steps above describe the full scope of the standard service. Anything not listed &mdash; or not itemised on page 1 &mdash; is out of scope and will be quoted separately.</div>

  <!-- ═══ TERMS & CONDITIONS — UGANDA ═══ -->
  <div style="font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;color:#666;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:5px;">TERMS &amp; CONDITIONS</div>
  <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;">
    <tr>
      <td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0 5px 0 0;width:33%;font-size:8px;color:#444;line-height:1.38;">
        <div style="padding:2px 0;"><b style="color:#D41C1C;">*</b> <b style="color:#141414;">1. Agreement &amp; Acceptance:</b> This quotation, these Terms &amp; Conditions, the Service Agreement on pages 3&ndash;4 and DishNet's published policies (Terms of Service, Terms of Sale, Warranty Policy and Returns, Refunds and Cancellations, at dishnetuganda.com/policies.html) form the agreement between the customer and DishNet Africa Ltd. Where anything in this quotation is less favourable to the customer than those policies, the policies apply. No verbal statement or promise binds DishNet unless confirmed in writing by an authorised DishNet representative.</div>
        <div style="padding:2px 0;"><b style="color:#D41C1C;">*</b> <b style="color:#141414;">2. Currency &amp; Pricing:</b> All prices in Ugandan Shillings (UGX). {# 5.18.49 (docs/42 §9): every quotation says what its prices include, in the words the operator approved on 27 Sep 2026; the WhatsApp quotation summary and the assistant say the same. Self-contained so staff can replace this one line in uCRM. #}{% if totals.taxes|length > 0 %}VAT is itemised in the totals on page 1.{% else %}All prices include all taxes &mdash; URA taxes and UCC charges are already in them. Nothing is added on top.{% endif %} Prices may change with 30 days' notice.</div>
        <div style="padding:2px 0;"><b style="color:#D41C1C;">*</b> <b style="color:#141414;">3. Payment:</b> Service is prepaid — the monthly fee is due before the start of each service month. Service pauses automatically at the end of an unpaid period, without liability to DishNet, and resumes on payment. Service is not paused over an amount the customer disputes while DishNet checks it.</div>
        <div style="padding:2px 0;"><b style="color:#D41C1C;">*</b> <b style="color:#141414;">4. Title &amp; Risk:</b> Ownership of purchased equipment passes to the customer only on full payment; until then it remains DishNet property and may be recovered. Risk of loss or damage passes to the customer on delivery to the premises.</div>
        <div style="padding:2px 0;"><b style="color:#D41C1C;">*</b> <b style="color:#141414;">5. Installation &amp; Premises:</b> Professional installation as quoted; non-standard mounting (roof, pole, long cable runs) is agreed and charged separately before work begins. The customer warrants they have the right to install at the premises and is responsible for any landlord or premises dispute. Minor drilling and mounting marks are a normal part of installation; DishNet is not liable for pre-existing structural defects.</div>
        <div style="padding:2px 0;"><b style="color:#D41C1C;">*</b> <b style="color:#141414;">6. Handover:</b> At handover we show the service working. Your sign-off confirms you received the installation; it does not take away DishNet's warranty or any right the law gives you.</div>
        <div style="padding:2px 0;"><b style="color:#D41C1C;">*</b> <b style="color:#141414;">7. Cancellation &amp; Refunds:</b> Cancel with notice before the next billing date, or pause where Starlink allows it. Fees for a started service month, and installation fees once work has begun, are not refundable, except where the law gives a right that cannot be excluded. Equipment may be returned within 7 days of delivery under DishNet's Returns policy; faulty equipment is always covered.</div>
      </td>
      <td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0 5px;width:33%;font-size:8px;color:#444;line-height:1.38;">
        <div style="padding:2px 0;"><b style="color:#D41C1C;">*</b> <b style="color:#141414;">8. Third-Party Network:</b> Internet is delivered over the Starlink satellite network, which is owned and operated by Starlink, not DishNet. Speeds, coverage, availability, network policies and network pricing are determined by Starlink and may change without DishNet's control. DishNet does not warrant uninterrupted or fault-free service; its responsibility for outages, degradation or changes on the Starlink network is as DishNet's Terms of Service set out. The customer must also follow Starlink's Acceptable Use and Fair Use Policies (starlink.com/legal).</div>
        <div style="padding:2px 0;"><b style="color:#D41C1C;">*</b> <b style="color:#141414;">9. Independent Company:</b> DishNet Africa Ltd is an independent Ugandan company. It is not an agent, partner, franchisee, affiliate, or representative of Starlink or SpaceX, and nothing in this agreement creates such a relationship. "Starlink" and related marks belong to their owners and are used only to identify the network and equipment. DishNet's commitments do not bind Starlink, and Starlink's publications do not bind DishNet.</div>
        <div style="padding:2px 0;"><b style="color:#D41C1C;">*</b> <b style="color:#141414;">10. Account &amp; Continuity:</b> Under a DishNet service plan, the Starlink account serving the customer is registered and managed by DishNet; the customer's contract is with DishNet only, and no direct contract with Starlink arises from this quotation unless a transfer is separately agreed in writing. If the network, account or applicable network policies make continued service impossible, unlawful or impracticable for reasons outside DishNet's control, DishNet may migrate the customer to an equivalent solution or terminate the service, and refunds any unused prepaid service fees.</div>
        <div style="padding:2px 0;"><b style="color:#D41C1C;">*</b> <b style="color:#141414;">11. Service &amp; Support:</b> DishNet provides installation and after-sales support on +256 705 993 348 and, under a DishNet service plan, account management. Support covers the DishNet-supplied installation and, under a DishNet service plan, the Starlink account; the customer's own devices, internal networks and third-party equipment are outside scope and chargeable on request.</div>
